			"updated": 1792346423089,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Functional Requirement \n1. limit the no of request \n2.Rate limit rules should be Dynamic Configurable \n3.give meaning full response (429 too many request)\n4.Should be able to handle the Burst Traffic \n5.Based on the application Tier allow No of request(\nbasic, premium tier )\n\nNon Functional Requirement \n1.Scale is 1 millton request per sec \n2.Highly Available \n3.Low latency ( <5ms)\n4. Eventual consistency for Rules to propagate\n   ",
